            // day the fixtures above draw hot (it passed 432). Warming that from the national
            // 60.5 F inlet to the 125 F setpoint of the LBNL report above (a 35.8 C rise) is 4.6
            // kWh of heat a day, about half the RECS figure: the rest is the tank's standby loss
